{"title":"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number that goes into the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/2/c12dda010ebddef028cda1ec9d14986f4a26d07e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Box$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"11\" /> to make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/6/c46934d9e9125799c7772b891b19d2737d5c42f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{7} = \\frac{\\Box}{63}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"38\" /> true is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/e/abedd48c092bca180ab196494d772e93b7e49712.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 27 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 9 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 59 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 63 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"378\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/1/3c155b6c16fac37a9d266e8c8869792b94c388bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{63}{7} = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/c/cdcb768024d29bc56491b4ebe692566a766decb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Box = 3 \\times 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff00237e4b31c2007d37f3b40025b564eebb544.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } 27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"67\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gau